          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand to-cyanGlow flex items-center justify-center text-sm shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            🗿
          </div>
          <div class="bg-panel border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm px-4 py-3 max-w-[85%] text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300">Gabut AI</div>
            <p>Halo! Selamat datang di Web App resmi <strong>Gabut AI</strong>. 😎</p>
            <p>Lagi bosen, pengen tebak-tebakan receh, atau mau kirim foto buat aku komentari? Langsung ketik aja di bawah!</p>
          </div>
